    "id": "pose_49_kneeling_leaning_sideways",
    "name": "Kneeling, leaning sideways with a hand reaching to the floor",
    "description": "Kneeling on both knees with the torso leaning hard to the right, the right arm reaching straight down-out toward the floor beside the knee as far as the rig's arm reach allows while the left arm stretches up and out diagonally with an open hand. The head tilts with the lean. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the lean uses the maximum legal torso roll and the hand still hovers above the floor because the rig's arm cannot span the leaned shoulder-to-floor distance.",
      "Knees and toes share floor contact; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_stand2.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
